<title>USA: HA-LO completes acquisition of Bradley.</title>
<headline>HA-LO completes acquisition of Bradley.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc, which distributes specialty and premium advertising products, said Wednesday it has completed a previously announced acquisition of Bradley Marketing Group of Detroit, Mich.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bradley Marketing Group provides promotional products and had 1996 revenues of $9.7 million. Bradley's operations and facilities will be consolidated with HA-LO's promotional division in Detroit.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
